      "aboutTitle": "I'm Batuhan",
      "aboutText": "I'm a full-stack developer building apps for the web and mobile. I write interfaces with React, TypeScript and Tailwind, and backends with Java, Spring Boot, Node.js and SQL. My reflex game Salise, built with React Native and Expo, is live on Google Play."
